ry/sentry/commit/e868fc70ce275d60742f43cc90d75483e87de007", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/commits/e868fc70ce275d60742f43cc90d75483e87de007/comments", "author": null, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "6332ef4a5594cb3d38abbdffb22dd3e7dcd58702", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/commits/6332ef4a5594cb3d38abbdffb22dd3e7dcd58702", "html_url": "https://github.com/getsentry/sentry/commit/6332ef4a5594cb3d38abbdffb22dd3e7dcd58702"}]}, {"sha": "4d521268ba5f79bd741736b98ad5fe916c6ac996", "node_id": "C_kwDOAA1TcNoAKDRkNTIxMjY4YmE1Zjc5YmQ3NDE3MzZiOThhZDVmZTkxNmM2YWM5OTY", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Ahmed Etefy", "email": "ahmed.etefy@sentry.io", "date": "2022-10-03T09:20:44Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2022-10-03T09:20:44Z"}, "message": "feat(metrics): Add `team_key_transaction` to metrics layer [TET-325 TET-426] (#39412)\n\nAdds support for `team_key_transaction` to be added\r\nto the metrics layer. As of these changes, we should be able to\r\nselect, groupBy and orderBy team_key_transaction\r\n\r\nThis PR achieves the following by\r\n- Adds a new derived operation `team_key_transaction` and accepts\r\ntransaction.duration MRI as a metric mri\r\n- Modifying `MetricsGroupByField` to also accept an instance of\r\n`MetricField`\r\n- Modifying `MetricsExpressionBase` that has a\r\n`generate_groupby_statement` that generates SNQL but also validates that\r\nthe metrics expression supports grouping by\r\n- Refactor shared logic out of `SnubaQueryBuilder._build_groupby` and\r\n`_get_group_limit_filters` into a static method\r\n`SnubaQueryBuilder.generate_snql_for_groupby_field`", "tree": {"sha": "191943ff38c3a747ac9aa141d7809c68454f1262", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/trees/191943ff38c3a747ac9aa141d7809c68454f1262"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/commits/4d521268ba5f79bd741736b98ad5fe916c6ac996", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJjOqlsCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAYLoIADaw4DlLw896c4gA2zc2aW2w\n6tMPpAmfMhyHctLdxh35dX1c9lPj6qt/0JyYucHRewO/PWy3Az68YsAEtgRqXDsT\nJDqgEjncPSxHAwu6k8xIQrqN7GivRL9JRC5+9YhXt/eUBoaP2ji+TxxzyolfMbHz\nYXc/gTHrdGedfnSidT8wGftDpbaJB1K+TwfspyMfJzWjVh4L2rYmOHGzP9/J6jUq\nfYQo5kkCvdpnJbsAh22vSJgznG59uH8iNuacMimoPtvKL4PfF0erP8AlY99h1yF8\nbz8AwqBBv1XfcFomI/EqOm9IxEX+hvRHQuJ/q2YNsNIdAA2r8vHu1Esl5k7auYw=\n=RogJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 191943ff38c3a747ac9aa141d7809c68454f1262\nparent ceb97412d5622228fbfc0fc96ef68670d73a9ae5\nauthor Ahmed Etefy <ahmed.etefy@sentry.io> 1664788844 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1664788844 +0200\n\nfeat(metrics): Add `team_key_transaction` to metrics layer [TET-325 TET-426] (#39412)\n\nAdds support for `team_key_transaction` to be added\r\nto the metrics layer. As of these changes, we should be able to\r\nselect, groupBy and orderBy team_key_transaction\r\n\r\nThis PR achieves the following by\r\n- Adds a new derived operation `team_key_transaction` and accepts\r\ntransaction.duration MRI as a metric mri\r\n- Modifying `MetricsGroupByField` to also accept an instance of\r\n`MetricField`\r\n- Modifying `MetricsExpressionBase` that has a\r\n`generate_groupby_statement` that generates SNQL but also validates that\r\nthe metrics expression supports grouping by\r\n- Refactor shared logic out of `SnubaQueryBuilder._build_groupby` and\r\n`_get_group_limit_filters` into a static method\r\n`SnubaQueryBuilder.generate_snql_for_groupby_field`", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/commits/4d521268ba5f79bd741736b98ad5fe916c6ac996", "html_url": "https://github.com/getsentry/sentry/commit/4d521268ba5f79bd741736b98ad5fe916c6ac996", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/commits/4d521268ba5f79bd741736b98ad5fe916c6ac996/comments", "author": null, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "ceb97412d5622228fbfc0fc96ef68670d73